 <p>The Net Present Value (NPV) is calculated using the formula: \[
-\text{NPV} = \sum_{t=1}^{n} (\text{cash flow at } t) \times v^t \]</p>
+\text{NPV} = -C_0 + \sum_{t=1}^{n} CF_t \, v^t, \qquad v = \frac{1}{1+r}
+\]</p>
 <p>Where:</p>
